          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Details",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading_size": 16,
            "content": "<h3>Portable Baby Sound Machine & Sleep Soother</h3><p>👶 <strong>20 Soothing Sounds</strong> – White noise, heartbeat, ocean sounds, and more to create a calming environment for your baby.</p><p>🔋 <strong>15-Hour Battery Life</strong> – USB-C rechargeable for convenient use at home or on the go.</p><p>⏰ <strong>Smart Sleep Timer</strong> – Automatically turns off based on your selected timer setting.</p><p>💤 <strong>No Wi-Fi or App Needed</strong> – Simple, easy-to-use buttons for everyday convenience.</p><p>✈️ <strong>Compact & Travel-Friendly</strong> – Lightweight, palm-sized design with a hanging loop for strollers, diaper bags, and travel.</p>",
            "content_size": 14,
