          "settings": {
            "heading": "How To Use",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading_size": 16,
            "content": "<h3>🍼 How To Use</h3><p><strong>Step 1: Charge Your Sound Machine</strong><br/>Connect the included USB-C cable to fully charge the device before use.</p><p><strong>Step 2: Turn It On</strong><br/>Press the power button to switch on the sound machine.</p><p><strong>Step 3: Choose Your Soothing Sound</strong><br/>Use the + and – buttons to browse through 20 calming sounds, including white noise, heartbeat, and ocean sounds.</p><p><strong>Step 4: Set the Sleep Timer</strong><br/>Press the timer button to activate your preferred automatic shut-off setting.</p><p><strong>Step 5: Place It Safely</strong><br/>Place the machine on a stable surface or securely attach the hanging loop to your stroller handle, away from your baby's reach.</p><p><strong>Step 6: Enjoy Peaceful Moments</strong><br/>Keep the volume low and let the soothing sounds create a relaxing atmosphere for your little one, whether at home or on the go.</p>",
            "content_size": 14,
