    "reviews_section_7Waym": {
      "type": "reviews-section",
      "blocks": {
        "review_iX6iBe": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "DJ",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>I absolutely love this sound machine! It lasts forever on one charge. I’ve let it play for 12+ hours. It’s the perfect noise level for any situation with your baby or even if you want to use it on the go for yourself. It’s hard for me to stay up when some of the sounds are playing lol it has a lot of different sound options as well<br/>10/10 recommend!<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "review_a1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Tatum phillips",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>Amazing quality! Especially for the price, this is a staple piece in our household and i HIGHLY recommend it. Perfect size for travel and the little strap makes it super convenient to attach to just about anywhere. Used this the whole time we were in the hospital and it never ran out of battery. There’s a variety of different sounds which is nice and the volume is perfect, not too loud, but just enough to put our baby to sleep. I also love that it takes a type c charger, but again, the battery life is incredible.<br/><br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/61N3fGhp9eL.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_a2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Laura K.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>I have purchased so many sound machines in the past. This by far is the best, easy to use, keeps a charge, small and compact. I will be purchasing more for my family members.<br/><br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/71xee7rmRKL.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_a3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Victoria Searles",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>The sleep quality my little one gets when this is on is unmatched. He loves the ocean noises. The battery life is amazing on it, great for travel. Very reliable!<br/><br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/511YS-LqxvL._SY500.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_a4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Jessica T.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>Ever since I got this white noise speaker, it has become part of our daily routine. I love that it includes relaxing sounds like rain and thunder, creating a calm and peaceful atmosphere.</p><p>We use it during nap time or at bedtime, and it helps create a more relaxing environment at home. It's also compact, easy to use, and convenient to take anywhere. If you're looking for a white noise speaker with soothing sounds, this is a great option.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/61esT6uc83L._SY500.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_a5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Yanis Barreto Ortega",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>I’m very impressed with this portable baby sound machine. It’s well-made, easy to use, and incredibly convenient to take anywhere. The sound quality is clear and consistent, making it a great addition to our baby’s sleep routine. The buttons are easy to find and use, which makes adjusting the settings quick and simple. The battery life is also excellent and lasts a very long time between charges, making it especially convenient when we’re away from home. Overall, it’s a practical, reliable, and high-quality product that I would highly recommend to other parents.<br/><br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/61SVZuL_oXL.jpg"
          }
        },
        "review_wch9ap": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Lylacscc",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>This little sound machine has quickly become one of my favorite baby essentials. It’s compact enough to keep in the diaper bag, so it’s convenient for naps on the go, traveling, or moving from room to room.</p><p></p><p>I really like the variety of sound options and the timer feature. The controls are simple, and despite its small size, the sound is clear and provides good coverage without needing the volume too high. The neutral Putty color is also cute and blends nicely with baby gear.</p><p></p><p>What I appreciate most is the portability—you’re not limited to using it only in the nursery. It’s practical, easy to use, and something I actually reach for regularly. A great option for parents looking for a travel-friendly sound machine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "review_cUryjU": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 4,
            "author": "Nicole B.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>This is very handy and there’s quite a few sound to choose from. The reason I chose 4 stars however, is because the lullabies are a short snippet of the song and play on a loop which isn’t the worst thing, but I just wish it would replay the whole lullaby. Secondly I wish I could make the sounds/noise one or two notches quieter than the quietest the machine gets. On a budget, this is a good little sound machine. Not sure how the battery life is as I usually always charge it after I’m done using it.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "review_ra6AQV": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "author": "Laura K.",
            "date": "",
            "verified": true,
            "body": "<p>This is AMAZING! I’ve never wrote a review before until now<br/>Great noise level whether loud or quiet and will stay on for days. The slightest charge will keep the machine running for hours. My newborn loves the sound and helps him sleep well. Many choices of sound to pick from whether a heartbeat to remind ur little one of the pregnancy or cute lullaby’s. Overall it’s a great purchase I am beyond happy.<br/><br/></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/618-rZ5cibL.jpg"
          }
        }
      },
